#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""gitdash: a live browser dashboard of a git repo's uncommitted changes.

Run it anywhere inside a git work tree. It serves a page on 127.0.0.1 that
shows every change in the working tree and index against HEAD (untracked,
non-ignored files count as Added) and pushes updates over Server-Sent Events
the moment anything changes. Python 3 standard library only.
"""

